      "body": "loaded_heterocycle_pyrazole → stability"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] design MOFs with a 3-dimensional pore structure containing many available protons and proton carriers with high rotational freedom → described as a desirable configuration for proton-conducting MOFs"
    },
    {
      "title": "Design Rule",
      "body": "[positive] increase the number of charge carriers by introducing acidic moieties or protonated N-heterocycles into the framework or as guests in proton conduction channels → identified as one of three strategies for achieving better and higher conducting MOFs"
    },
